---
permalink: /archive/
world: neutral
title: ARCHIVE
description: OKstyle LAB & PLAY の全記事一覧（年別）。
---
{%- set years = collections.articles | groupByYear %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="page-hero__kicker">ARCHIVE</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">全記事一覧</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lead">{{ (years | last).year }}年から続く {{ collections.articles.length }} 本の記録。新しい順・年別に並べています。</p>
    <nav class="year-nav" aria-label="年へ移動">
      {%- for g in years %}
      <a href="#y{{ g.year }}">{{ g.year }}<small>{{ g.posts.length }}</small></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container archive">
  {%- for g in years %}
  <section class="archive__year" id="y{{ g.year }}" aria-labelledby="y{{ g.year }}-h">
    <h2 class="archive__heading" id="y{{ g.year }}-h">{{ g.year }}<small>{{ g.posts.length }} 本</small></h2>
    {%- set listPosts = g.posts %}
    {% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
